Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): show key rejected on provider authentication
 failure

Classify provider authentication failures distinctly from generic request failures. Display safe key rejected status without exposing raw provider responses or secrets. Add deterministic test pins.

Fixes #3804
